    "type": "game",
    "name": "States of Power",
    "steam_appid": 3126500,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >States of Power is a grand strategy wargame focused on strategic control of your army's divisions and units. The game is designed for smooth multiplayer gameplay and offers deep customisation in singleplayer. Control a nation of your choice - or one you create - in World War II era customisable scenarios, or let the game run simulations on its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encircle. Break. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command every division directly. Build an army tailored to your strategy - infantry, tanks, artillery, fighter planes, and more. Each unit excels against some and falters against others. Adapt to shifting frontlines and avoid overstretching your supply lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/10e1901568bfb40f0a2faf11c27695a7.poster.avif?t=1750340180\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/10e1901568bfb40f0a2faf11c27695a7.webm?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/10e1901568bfb40f0a2faf11c27695a7.mp4?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete in ruthless diplomacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances for survival or manipulate others before the backstab. Guarantee independence, send \u201cvolunteers\u201d to foreign wars, or quietly prepare for war. Multiplayer diplomacy is fast and brutal - with global and private messaging built in, your words are weapons too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create custom nations and scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own nation with a unique flag, or fill the world map with real or fictional countries of your choosing. Build alternate histories, weird what-ifs, or pure chaos with the custom scenario editor.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/d0d769a01d204e532cf12c09c0e231c0.poster.avif?t=1750340180\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/d0d769a01d204e532cf12c09c0e231c0.webm?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/d0d769a01d204e532cf12c09c0e231c0.mp4?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge your path with technology</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your country\u2019s evolution through a semi-randomized tech tree. Upgrade your unit strength, unlock economic power, and shape your playstyle through research.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >States of Power is a grand strategy wargame focused on strategic control of your army's divisions and units. The game is designed for smooth multiplayer gameplay and offers deep customisation in singleplayer. Control a nation of your choice - or one you create - in World War II era customisable scenarios, or let the game run simulations on its own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encircle. Break. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command every division directly. Build an army tailored to your strategy - infantry, tanks, artillery, fighter planes, and more. Each unit excels against some and falters against others. Adapt to shifting frontlines and avoid overstretching your supply lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/10e1901568bfb40f0a2faf11c27695a7.poster.avif?t=1750340180\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/10e1901568bfb40f0a2faf11c27695a7.webm?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/10e1901568bfb40f0a2faf11c27695a7.mp4?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete in ruthless diplomacy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form alliances for survival or manipulate others before the backstab. Guarantee independence, send \u201cvolunteers\u201d to foreign wars, or quietly prepare for war. Multiplayer diplomacy is fast and brutal - with global and private messaging built in, your words are weapons too.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create custom nations and scenarios</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your own nation with a unique flag, or fill the world map with real or fictional countries of your choosing. Build alternate histories, weird what-ifs, or pure chaos with the custom scenario editor.  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/d0d769a01d204e532cf12c09c0e231c0.poster.avif?t=1750340180\" width=600 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/d0d769a01d204e532cf12c09c0e231c0.webm?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3126500/extras/d0d769a01d204e532cf12c09c0e231c0.mp4?t=1750340180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge your path with technology</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide your country\u2019s evolution through a semi-randomized tech tree. Upgrade your unit strength, unlock economic power, and shape your playstyle through research.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lead your nation in this strategy wargame set during WWII. Build up the economy, command unit divisions and dominate the world, online or in singleplayer! Create custom and alternate history scenarios, simulate them or play as one of the nations.",
